PROJECT: Movement Labs

## Ecosystem Position

Primary Sector: Move-based modular blockchain stack / Layer 2 execution environment (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]
Secondary Sector: Ethereum L2 scaling / Modular blockchain infrastructure (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]
Primary Chain: Ethereum (L1 settlement untuk M1 rollup) (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]
Supported Chains: Movement M1 (L2, pre-mainnet), Parthenon Testnet (MEVM testnet), Planned: Movement Network multi-chain (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/; Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/

## External Dependencies

Dependency Name: Ethereum
Dependency Type: Chain
Purpose: Layer 1 settlement, finality, data availability (fallback), economic security untuk M1 rollup
Criticality: Critical
Status: Live (testnet Parthenon menggunakan Ethereum Sepolia/Holesky untuk settlement)
Related Entity: Ethereum
Related Technology Component: Ethereum Settlement Contracts, M1 Sequencer, Parthenon Testnet
