## Ecosystem Risks

Risk: Single Chain Settlement Dependency — M1 bergantung sepenuhnya pada Ethereum L1 untuk finality, settlement, dan economic security; tidak ada alternative settlement layer
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/

Risk: Planned DA Layer Dependencies Not Live — Celestia, Avail, EigenDA integrations diumumkan tapi belum live di testnet; mainnet launch bergantung pada minimal satu DA adapter berfungsi
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/

Risk: Centralized Sequencer (Testnet) — Parthenon testnet menggunakan single sequencer dioperasikan Movement Labs; single point of failure untuk transaction ordering, censorship resistance tidak ada
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/

Risk: No Security Audit Completed — MoveVM, MEVM, Movement SDK, M1 settlement contracts belum memiliki laporan audit publik; mainnet launch memerlukan audit completion
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/, https://github.com/movementlabsxyz, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/

Risk: Financial Dependency on Series A Proceeds — Single known funding round $38M; tidak ada revenue; runway bergantung pada treasury management; token treasury belum exist
Sources: https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/movement-labs, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/

Risk: Move Ecosystem Fragmentation — Movement bergantung pada upstream Move toolchain (compiler, prover, VM) yang dikembangkan oleh Aptos/Sui/0L; divergensi spec atau breaking changes upstream mempengaruhi Movement
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/, https://github.com/movementlabsxyz

Risk: Regulatory Uncertainty (US) — Delaware C-Corp issuing token MOVE; US securities law (Howey test) applicability ke MOVE token belum diklarifikasi; bisa mempengaruhi TGE dan operasi
Sources: https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/movement-labs, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Risk: MEVM Compatibility Gaps — MEVM tidak 100% kompatibel EVM (precompiles, opcode, gas semantics); aplikasi Ethereum existing mungkin butuh modifikasi untuk deploy di M1
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/

