## Summary

Primary Ecosystem: Move-based modular blockchain stack (Movement SDK, MoveVM, MEVM) dengan Ethereum sebagai settlement layer
Supported Chains: Ethereum (L1 settlement, live testnet), Movement M1 (L2, pre-mainnet), Parthenon Testnet (MEVM, live), Planned: Movement Network multi-chain
External Dependencies: 8 dependencies (1 Critical Chain: Ethereum; 3 High Planned DA: Celestia, Avail, EigenDA; 1 Critical SDK: Move toolchain; 1 High Infra: GitHub; 1 Critical Financial: Series A Investors; 1 High Cloud: K8s/Cloud provider; 1 Medium Community: Discord)
Major Integrations: 7 integrations (1 Live testnet: Parthenon↔Ethereum; 2 Live dev: SDK↔VM, MEVM↔Hardhat/Foundry; 4 Planned: DA adapters x3, Network Coordinator)
Infrastructure Providers: 5 providers (GitHub, Discord, Ethereum RPC, Cloud/K8s, Self-hosted Explorer)
Developer Programs: SDK, CLI, API, Docs, GitHub repos live; Hackathon & Grant Program belum diumumkan
Applications: 0 live (pre-mainnet)
Governance: 0 entities (pre-TGE, no Foundation/DAO)

